   "num": "01",
   "kind": "short",
   "intro": "<p>A student investigated competition between wheat and wild oat, a weed of wheat fields. She filled identical pots with the same volume of the same compost. In each pot she planted 8 wheat seedlings and 0, 4, 8, 16 or 32 wild oat seedlings. She set up three pots of each type and grew them under lamps in a laboratory growth room for 28 days, giving each pot the same volume of water. She then cut the wheat shoots at the compost surface, dried them and found the mean dry mass per wheat plant.</p><figure><div style=\"overflow-x:auto;max-width:100%\"><table class=\"tbl\"><caption>Table 1</caption><thead><tr><th scope=\"col\" style=\"text-transform:none;letter-spacing:0;font-size:.85rem;color:inherit;padding:.3rem .4rem\">Wild oat plants per pot</th><th scope=\"col\" style=\"text-transform:none;letter-spacing:0;font-size:.85rem;color:inherit;padding:.3rem .4rem\">0</th><th scope=\"col\" style=\"text-transform:none;letter-spacing:0;font-size:.85rem;color:inherit;padding:.3rem .4rem\">4</th><th scope=\"col\" style=\"text-transform:none;letter-spacing:0;font-size:.85rem;color:inherit;padding:.3rem .4rem\">8</th><th scope=\"col\" style=\"text-transform:none;letter-spacing:0;font-size:.85rem;color:inherit;padding:.3rem .4rem\">16</th><th scope=\"col\" style=\"text-transform:none;letter-spacing:0;font-size:.85rem;color:inherit;padding:.3rem .4rem\">32</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th scope=\"row\" style=\"text-transform:none;letter-spacing:0;font-size:.85rem;color:inherit;padding:.3rem .4rem\">Mean dry mass per wheat plant / mg</th><td style=\"padding:.3rem .4rem\">210</td><td style=\"padding:.3rem .4rem\">176</td><td style=\"padding:.3rem .4rem\">148</td><td style=\"padding:.3rem .4rem\">103</td><td style=\"padding:.3rem .4rem\">61</td></tr></tbody></table></div><figcaption class=\"small\">Hypothetical data. Each value is the mean for three pots.</figcaption></figure>",
